In commit https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35728/changes/3333a91dbf1eac659cd7d027bc891a80241e8f66: _rpc: Properly throw on internal FindTx IO errors in ProcessPSBT and GetTransaction_

nit: Here I think what is missing is the block data and not the index

```diff --git a/src/index/txindex.cpp b/src/index/txindex.cpp
index d608e733f3..9ec5c2e857 100644
--- a/src/index/txindex.cpp
+++ b/src/index/txindex.cpp
@@ -196,7 +196,7 @@ std::optional<TxIndexResult> TxIndex::FindTx(const Txid& tx_hash) const
                                           GetName(), candidate_block_hash.ToString(), tx_hash.ToString()));
             }
             if (!(block_index->nStatus & BLOCK_HAVE_DATA)) {
-                WarnAndThrowErr(strprintf("%s: Block index entry %s unexpectedly unavailable for txid %s. Caused by data corruption or possibly an unclean shutdown?",
+                WarnAndThrowErr(strprintf("%s: Block data %s unexpectedly unavailable for txid %s. Caused by data corruption or possibly an unclean shutdown?",
                                           GetName(), candidate_block_hash.ToString(), tx_hash.ToString()));
             }
             const FlatFilePos tx_position{block_index->nFile, block_index->nDataPos + key.pos.tx_offset_in_block};
```

